(6, 5, 1, 'Nechung Monastery', 0, 'nechung-monastery', 'dharmshala', 'Goa', 'Aldona', 'Goa', '[\"2\",\"3\"]', '[\"8\",\"6\"]', '09:00:00', '12:00:00', 'Experience luxury at The Park New Delhi Hotel with pool views from upscale rooms. Enjoy a spa, salon, and nightclub. Savor delicious cuisine at multiple restaurants and bars. Unique butler services enhance your stay. Conveniently located in Delhi with easy access to nearby attractions for a memorable solo traveler stay. The Park New Delhi Hotel offers convenience and easy access to popular attractions in Central Delhi. Enjoy exclusive amenities like a delicious breakfast takeaway service and an indoor pool. Well-equipped rooms with AC, complimentary Wi-Fi, and plush towel showers. Explore nearby landmarks including Gurdwara Bangla Sahib, Connaught Place, and Rashtrapati Bhavan. Book now for an exceptional solo travel experience.\r\nExperience luxury at The Park New Delhi Hotel with pool views from upscale rooms. Enjoy a spa, salon, and nightclub. Savor delicious cuisine at multiple restaurants and bars. Unique butler services enhance your stay.Experience luxury at The Park New Delhi Hotel with pool views from upscale rooms. Enjoy a spa, salon, and nightclub. Savor delicious cuisine at multiple restaurants and bars. Unique butler services enhance your stay. Conveniently located in Delhi with easy access to nearby attractions for a memorable solo traveler stay. The Park New Delhi Hotel offers convenience and easy access to popular attractions in Central Delhi. Enjoy exclusive amenities like a delicious breakfast takeaway service and an indoor pool. Well-equipped rooms with AC, complimentary Wi-Fi, and plush towel showers. Explore nearby landmarks including Gurdwara Bangla Sahib, Connaught Place, and Rashtrapati Bhavan. Book now for an exceptional solo travel experience.\r\nExperience luxury at The Park New Delhi Hotel with pool views from upscale rooms. Enjoy a spa, salon, and nightclub. Savor delicious cuisine at multiple restaurants and bars. Unique butler services enhance your stay.', 3000.00, 3, NULL, NULL, 'The Lalit New Delhi is a very classy hotel and the staff have been well trained and are extremely responsive to its guests. I would not hesitate to book here again when I am next in New Delhi and would recommend this establishment without.', '1750399715.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'index,follow', 1, 1, 1, '2025-06-20 11:38:35', '2025-11-13 18:18:40');
